\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  When someone professes to love God,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj But loveth not his companion;
\par He  only lies and speaks not the truth,
\par And he shall stay forever dead.
\par  The Lord our God is love and wants
\par :/:   Us all to love one another. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.     We have one father and one Lord God,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj  And we are likened one in flesh.
\par  I must therefore love my own neighbour,
\par  As truly as I love myself.
\par   God, in creating all the world,
\par  :/: Never meant it for one person. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus is the savour of us all,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj He gave Himself to all mankind.
\par   Their redemption has life and value,
\par  Will it therefore be possible,
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0\qj   To hate my friend for whom He died,
\par  :/: For whom He shed His precious
\par blood ? :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     4.  A constant sinner I'm before God,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 But he forgives me everyday.
\par Therefore when a brother offends me,
\par Commits acts unpleasant to me,
\par :/: Never shall I become distressed,:/:
\par Nor seek to pay him as deserved.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-360\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par     5. When I deal fairly with the faithful,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 And provide a cup of water,
\par Unto the least amongst the lot,
\par His thirst to satisfy thereby,
\par The good Lord sees it as an act
\par :/: Offered for his own benefit. :/:
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6. But he shall not receive compassion,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0\qj That never was compassionate
\par Thou art condemned that harbuor hatred,
\par Recompense is thine only wish.
\par Therefore request the Lord each day,
\par \pard        :/: To plant in thee a heart of love. :/:\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

